      "description": "Level-0 bordered surface; lifts on hover when it is a link.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-card ds-surface-hover\"><p class=\"ds-eyebrow\">Complementary</p><h3 class=\"ds-card-title\">Magnesium glycinate</h3><p class=\"ds-card-desc\">Taken beside, not instead of. Informational only.</p></div>",
      "css": ".ds-card{background:var(--card,#fff);color:var(--foreground,#131a15);border:1px solid var(--border,rgba(19,26,21,.1));border-radius:8px;padding:20px;font-family:Manrope,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-card-title{margin:12px 0 0;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;line-height:1;letter-spacing:-.02em}.ds-card-desc{margin:8px 0 0;font-size:14px;line-height:1.625;color:var(--muted-foreground,#5c675f)}.ds-surface-hover{transition:border-color .2s ease,box-shadow .2s ease,transform .2s ease}.ds-surface-hover:hover{border-color:color-mix(in srgb,var(--primary,#1f6b45) 35%,var(--border,rgba(19,26,21,.1)));box-shadow:0 10px 30px -18px color-mix(in srgb,var(--foreground,#131a15) 35%,transparent);transform:translateY(-1px)}.ds-eyebrow{margin:0;font-family:\"IBM Plex Mono\",ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;font-size:11px;line-height:16px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--primary,#1f6b45)}"
    },
